  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Cerita Bulan Ini, in the HitungCuan landing's \"Dapur Terang\" skin",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Warm cream page, white sheets with one soft shadow and a line ring.",
      "Every page answers first in a sentence; the key word sits on the indigo-tint band, the figure is gain or loss.",
      "Rekap is told in chapters: Untung bersih, Dari mana angkanya, Iklan, Pesanan & produk.",
      "One indigo accent for the primary action, links, kickers and focus; selected states are filled ink.",
      "Verdicts are stamp stickers (word + icon); no confetti, no word-by-word headlines."
